<title>USA: CET Environmental names Townsend CFO.</title>
<headline>CET Environmental names Townsend CFO.</headline>
<dateline>TUSTIN, Calif. 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>CET Environmental Services Inc Friday named Rick Townsend to the newly-created position of executive vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>In a statement, the environmental contracting and water treatment firm said Townsend previously was vice president and chief financial officer for the international operations of CH2M HILL, an environmental consulting and engineering firm.</p>
